    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that you aren't a doctor but i'm just trying to figure out if it's actually dangerous or just something to be careful with. i've taken zoloft for a long time so my body is used to it. is there a specific reason why they shouldn't be mixed? it seems like they're both just for management kind of things.",
