      "content": "The concern with mixing Tramadol and Zoloft relates to how they affect serotonin levels in the brain. Both medications influence neurotransmitter systems, and combining them carries a risk of a rare but serious condition called serotonin syndrome. Even with long-term use of Zoloft, this interaction must be evaluated by a healthcare professional. Please contact your prescribing physician or a pharmacist to discuss this safely.",
